---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import {sandwiches} from '../data/site.js';
---
<Layout title="Sandwich Cookies in Ruskin | Home is Cookie" description="Cookie sandwiches baked to order in Ruskin. Vanilla creme, Nutella spread, or peanut butter creme. $5 each, minimum six. Arranged pickup and delivery.">
<section class="wrap page-hero split"><div><p class="eyebrow">TWO COOKIES. ONE VERY GOOD REASON.</p><h1>Sandwich cookies,<br/><em>made to share.</em></h1><p>Two scratch-made cookies with a filling worth making room for. Choose chocolate chip with vanilla creme, chocolate chip with Nutella spread, or peanut butter with peanut butter creme.</p><p>$5 each · minimum 6 cookies · six for $30</p><a class="button" href="/order/?type=sandwich&quantity=6">Request 6 · $30 ↗</a></div><Photo src="sandwich" alt="Chocolate chip sandwich cookies filled with vanilla creme" class="photo" width={1200} height={900} priority/></section>
<section class="section wrap" style="padding-top:20px"><h2>Which filling will you choose?</h2><p>Sandwich cookies come in three flavor combinations, each $5. Order at least six cookies and tell us your preferred flavors and date. We’ll confirm availability, any flavor-mixing requests, and your final total before payment. Ruskin pickup and local delivery are arranged with your confirmed order.</p><div class="flavor-menu">{sandwiches.map(name=><div class="flavor-line">{name}<span>$5 each</span></div>)}</div><div class="split" style="margin-top:60px"><div><p class="eyebrow">SIX TO START. TWELVE TO SHARE.</p><h2>A little more<br/><em>in the middle.</em></h2><p>Six sandwich cookies are $30. Twelve are $60. Delivery, where available, is additional.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/order/?type=sandwich&quantity=6">Request 6 · $30 ↗</a><a class="button outline" href="/order/?type=sandwich&quantity=12">Request 12 · $60 ↗</a></div></div><div><h3>Made for your order.</h3><p>All cookies are made from scratch and baked to order. Contact us before ordering about dietary concerns; we cannot promise an allergen-free product. Follow the storage instructions supplied with your filled cookies.</p><a class="text-link" href="/ordering-delivery/">Ordering & delivery details →</a></div></div></section>
</Layout>
